  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Local consultant for Water Mission</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This assignment will enable the Netherlands embassy in Rabat, Morocco, to hire a relevant local consultant to prepare and partly implement a water mission between the Netherlands and Morocco from 19-22 April 2021 (PTM20MR01).This mission aims to enhance business partnerships, institutional cooperation, and capacity building. As this mission largely depends on a thorough understanding of the Moroccan challenges, ambitions, opportunities and players in the water sector, external advice and expertise are required to help and support the organisation of the Dutch Water mission.</narrative>
  </description>
